                    </span>
                </div>
                <h5 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight">No Events This Month</h5>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
                    You're all caught up! There are no exams, assignment deadlines, or scheduled activities for this month.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2.5">
                    <button onclick="openEventModal()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-md shadow-blue-200 flex items-center gap-2 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 cursor-pointer">
                        <i class="fas fa-plus text-[10px]"></i> Add Personal Event
